==Battleground==
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s (250%) spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Lazer (Enemy)|Dark Lazer]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s (900%) spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 0.33~1.33 seconds<sup>10f~40f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s (900%) spawn, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**1 [[Tackey]] spawns.
**5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s (900%) spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'noir]] spawns.
**2 [[Tackey]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**20 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**20 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Brainwashed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Mohawk Cat]] is a very valuable meatshield if you have him, as he can pretty consistently dodge all three traits present. At the start of the level, just use [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] to deal with the enemies easily. These enemies will drop a sufficient amount cash, so there is no need to worry about that. When you hit the base, start spawning [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife]] and [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] to deal with the peons. [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]] can snipe the enemies and, at a high enough level, can take them out easily. It's recommended to get Pizza Cat's [[Wave Attack]] Talent to deal with Le'noir as well as oncoming threats. Tackey can be countered by [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Golfer Cat]] at a high enough level as well, but Golfer is replaceable by other [[Long Distance]] Units.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Lightmother Aset (Uber Rare Cat)|Almighty Aset]]: She has really good health and DPS with a piercing wave that helps clear all the Sir Rels & can snipe Tackey.
*[[Twinstars (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Twinstars Φ]]: Twinstars are able to juggle and deal great damage to every enemy in the stage besides Le'Noir (including the Sir Rels and Aku Doges to a degree), while having a low recharge.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]: As with most Dark-dominant stages, Jizo does excellent at dealing with the trait, with this stage being no exception. This is only intensified if one happens to own his Ultra Form at this point of the game.

